!.env.example
# A real Film's folder holds unreleased plot (its Spoiler List) and footage:
# none of it, not even an editor backup, goes in git. Only the sample Film is tracked,
# and its footage stays out too.
films/*/
!films/agent-327/
films/*/source/
films/*/frames/
# The Eval Set's Blender Films are released, so their film.toml and Answer Key are tracked (ADR 0008);
# their footage isn't. Song Lang is a real Film, so none of its files are, and Claude's drafts stay local.
evals/films/*/source/
evals/films/*/frames/
evals/films/song-lang/
evals/expected/song-lang.toml
evals/drafts/

